From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] cu13 requirements: nvidia-cutlass-dsl 4.8.1

The pinned wheel set moves to 4.8.1 for the CUTLASS 4.8.1 headers; every other
consumer already accepts it (quack-kernels >= 4.7, flashinfer >= 4.6.2a0,
nccl4py ~= 4.6, cudnn-frontend >= 4.6.2).
---
diff --git a/requirements/cuda.txt b/requirements/cuda.txt
index 4b95ad7..b718d3d 100644
--- a/requirements/cuda.txt
+++ b/requirements/cuda.txt
@@ -28,7 +28,7 @@ fastsafetensors >= 0.3.3
 instanttensor >= 0.1.9
 
 # QuACK and Cutlass DSL for FA4 (cute-DSL implementation)
-nvidia-cutlass-dsl[cu13]==4.7.1
+nvidia-cutlass-dsl[cu13]==4.8.1
 quack-kernels==0.6.5  # Required by MSA
 
 # Tokenspeed_MLA for faster mla with spec decode
